 "description": "<p><b>Celebrate Seollal, the Korean Lunar New Year, with puzzles, coloring and a little Hangul.</b></p><p>This activity book mixes 15 large-print word searches with 15 bold and easy coloring pages. Find the words for tteokguk, New Year money, folk games and family visits, then color lucky Korean words such as 복 (good fortune), 행복 (happiness) and 희망 (hope).</p><ul><li>15 word searches, one per page, every word shown in English letters and Hangul</li><li>15 coloring pages printed on one side, with the meaning of each Korean word</li><li>Solutions at the back</li><li>8.5 x 11 inch pages</li></ul><p>A thoughtful Lunar New Year gift for K-drama fans, Korean-American families and anyone who loves Korea.</p>",
